  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 67e749f2b7d7bc244ac0f5a2749ac2ee, type: 3}
  m_Name: MusicBox
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LetterData
  contentList:
  - I hope you are not too busy getting all the presents ready!  This year for Christmas,
    I wish a music box please.
  - I hope you and your reindeer are doing okay!  This year, I would love a beautiful
    music box that plays a gentle melody. It would make my room feel magical. Thank
    you, Santa.
  - I hope you're doing well.  I dream of a small treasure that sings when opened.
